ast=Canter&amp;rft.aufirst=PH&amp;rft.au=Ernst%2C+E&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATranscendental+Meditation+technique" class="Z3988" about="#mwt457" id="mwDKU"></span></span></li>
